# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/centerline2.dl
import tests/cadkernel/arclength2/input.dl

set first to a cad line2 from (measure2 input point 1) to (measure2 input point 3)
set second to a cad line2 from (measure2 input point 5) to (measure2 input point 7)
set result to the cad centerline between first and second picked at (measure2 input point 9) and (measure2 input point 11) extended by (measure2 input 13) and (measure2 input 14)
emit measure2 flag result's valid
if result's valid:
    set value to result's value
    emit measure2 point value's start
    emit measure2 point value's end
    emit measure2 point value's baseStart
    emit measure2 point value's baseEnd
    emit measure2 flag ((the cad clone of value) = value)
